<%# max-w-3xl, which is what every other form page in the app uses. This was `lg:w-2/3`, a
    *fraction* of the viewport - on a 1920px monitor that is a 1280px-wide single-column form, with a
    name field stretched across all of it. A form's measure does not scale with the window. %>
<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
  <%= render layout: "components/ui/page_header",
             locals: { title: "Edit classroom",
                       description: "Changes apply to everyone who can see this classroom." } do %><% end %>

  <%= render "classrooms/form", classroom: @classroom %>
</div>
